  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Duke Long’s world shaking dragon hammer slams into Calamity Luck Altar. The front caves in, the house flies back dozens of steps, and a long trench opens in the ground. Bull Demon, Flower Lady, and Five Elements Grandmaster freeze at damage they cannot repair in time. A black light flies out of the River of Time, follows the hole into the interior, and becomes a Gu Immortal with curly black hair hanging down his waist. He waves a palm. Dark light surges, the house’s damage is repaired, and Longevity Heaven is pulled back from the brink. Bing Sai Chuan’s body shakes intensely.",
      "chapters": [
        1930
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_duke_long",
        "house_calamity_luck_altar",
        "char_bull_demon",
        "char_flower_lady",
        "char_five_elements_grandmaster",
        "loc_river_of_time",
        "sys_gu_immortal",
        "fac_longevity_heaven",
        "char_bing_sai_chuan"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "He is a young and handsome looking Gu Immortal with curly black hair hanging down his waist.",
      "chapters": [
        1930
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Inside Calamity Luck Altar he looks at Qin Ding Ling while gritting his teeth. Her luck path attainment lets her target the house well, and he and the rest are getting into a tight spot.",
      "chapters": [
        1932
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "house-under-attack",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_qin_ding_ling"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "After he wakes, he tells Bing Sai Chuan to crash Calamity Luck Altar into Heaven Overseeing Tower. Bing Sai Chuan asks Seventh Prince to take action. Qi Ci Lang answers that he is a luck path cultivator and is more suited to control Calamity Luck Altar. Bing Sai Chuan still holds the house’s control and had only given him a portion of the authority. Bing Sai Chuan teleports him out and tells him to attack quickly. Qi Ci Lang charges into Heaven Overseeing Tower, is hit by jade light, then a chess piece from Limitless Demon Venerable floats above his head and blocks most of it. He wants to get rid of the remaining jade light so he can move freely and snatch fate Gu.",
      "chapters": [
        1940
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "charge-into-heaven-overseeing-tower",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "house_heaven_overseeing_tower",
        "char_limitless_demon_venerable",
        "gu_fate_gu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "He is still bound by jade green light when Heavenly Court’s main force arrives and handles him easily. He cannot resist. He is beheaded and dies with grievance.",
      "chapters": [
        1948
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "death",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "fac_heavenly_court"
      ]
    }
  ],
